{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical Annihilation is a turn-based hexagon war game with high degree to strategic freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wage your warfare with dozens of unit\u00a0types  to fight on diversive terrains,\u00a0command devastating giant units, and cast\u00a0powerful skills that can turn the tide of a battle in a blink of an eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your base, produce units and destroy the enemy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/SteamStore1optimize.gif?t=1743695682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conquere the battlefield with 50+ unit types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/SteamStore2-optimize.gif?t=1743695682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as commanders with unique abilities and skills </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/SteamStore3-optimize.gif?t=1743695682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn the game through compaign mode with 20+ levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/SteamStore4-optimize.gif?t=1743695682\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Other Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a customized game in skirmish mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command massive units easily with\u00a0multi-select\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your own map with in-game editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note: graphics\u00a0recorded in alpha state and subject to change</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akama